    "reading": "Winter above-ground series 09000300122101061131500267I dated 2021-01-06 gives an unobstructed eastern front. Three dark granite ground bays, a deeper central door, framed glazed flanking bays and six gold Shanghai Municipal Archives characters are clear. Light-grey base courses under the outer wing windows, horizontal light stone joints and upper blue-grey panels are also visible. 2023-06-21 summer views show the surviving stepped tower and have leaf cover at the entry. The subterranean Bund Tunnel panoramas returned by location queries were excluded. The date codes identify the provider records, not a 2026 field measurement."
  },
